[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0909","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0909.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7445","title":"MikroTik RouterOS SMB 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CVE-2018-7445是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7445"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-19T21:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:08Z","remediation":"立即升级RouterOS到6.41.3及以上版本（如6.41.3/6.42rc27），强制应用安全补丁。如遇服务中断，可暂时停用SMB服务或通过防火墙封锁端口445以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Mar/38","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103427","https://www.coresecurity.com/advisories/mikrotik-routeros-smb-buffer-overflow","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44290/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-7445","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44290","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-7445.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2018/7xxx/CVE-2018-7445.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2018/7xxx/CVE-2018-7445.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-7445.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-7445.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-7445.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-7445.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-7445.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-7445.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/891288105232bf5472c62a89fd51ac6f1e7d82a2/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-7445.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0909.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0182","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0182.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-5233","title":"Grav CMS 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Grav CMS 1.3.0 之前版本中的 system/src/Grav/Common/Twig/Twig.php 存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 admin/tools 路径的 PATH_INFO 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员访问特制链接时触发执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击无需身份认证但需用户交互，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。官方已在 1.3.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-5233"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-19T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:59:53Z","remediation":"立即将 Grav CMS 升级至 1.3.0 或更高版本（建议使用最新稳定版）。可通过 Grav 官方 GPM 包管理器执行命令 `bin/gpm selfupgrade` 完成升级，或直接从 https://getgrav.org/downloads 下载最新版本覆盖安装。如暂时无法升级，应限制对 /admin/tools 路径的未授权访问，例如在 Web 服务器层（Nginx/Apache）添加访问控制规则，仅允许可信 IP 访问后台管理面板，以阻止攻击者通过 PATH_INFO 注入恶意脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2018/03/15/1","https://sysdream.com/news/lab/2018-03-15-cve-2018-5233-grav-cms-admin-plugin-reflected-cross-site-scripting-xss-vulnerability/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-5233.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-5233.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-5233.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-5233.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-5233-3567.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-5233-3565.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Grav CMS/CVE-2018-5233.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2018/CVE-2018-5233.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2018/5xxx/CVE-2018-5233.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-5233.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-5233.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0182.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0196","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0196.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7422","title":"WordPress Site Editor插件 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"WordPress插件Site Editor存在本地文件包含漏洞，影响1.1.1及以下版本。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向editor/extensions/pagebuilder/includes/ajax_shortcode_pattern.php文件的ajax_path参数发送特制请求，利用绝对路径遍历读取服务器上的任意文件内容。该漏洞利用门槛低，攻击者无需登录即可直接发起攻击，可能导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7422"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-19T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:06Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 WordPress Site Editor 插件至 1.1.2 或更高版本（已修复该 LFI 漏洞）。若无法升级，请通过 WordPress 后台禁用并删除该插件，或在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中添加规则拦截包含 `ajax_path` 参数且路径含 `../` 的请求，同时在 `.htaccess` 中禁止访问 `editor/extensions/pagebuilder/includes/ajax_shortcode_pattern.php` 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Mar/40","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9044","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44340/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44340","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7422.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7422.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/be4eb5d180ce03ee7726c0a777ec4071d20eced1/2018/CVE-2018-7422.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ab6f9d01ebd789d88d6c9c80d2c4801a89e1f38f/2018/CVE-2018-7422.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7422.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-7422.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7422-3592.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7422-3596.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7422-3594.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7422-3595.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2018-7422.yaml","https://github.com/0x00-0x00/CVE-2018-7422","https://github.com/ndr-repo/CVE-2018-7422","https://github.com/nguyenduytoi/CVE-2018-7422"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0196.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0216","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0216.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8770","title":"Western Bridge Cobub Razor 物理路径泄露漏洞","description":"Western Bridge Cobub Razor 0.8.0 存在物理路径泄露漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向特定页面发送恶意 HTTP 请求，触发 PHP 错误信息回显，从而泄露服务器绝对路径等敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Cobub Razor 0.8.0 及更早版本，攻击条件低，可被用于信息收集以辅助进一步攻击。目前官方尚未发布修复补丁，建议限制错误信息显示或部署 Web 应用防火墙进行防护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8770"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-18T00:00:00Z","updated":"2018-03-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"删除或移走生产环境中的 tests/ 目录（该目录仅用于开发测试，不应部署到线上）；在 php.ini 中设置 display_errors = Off 并重启 Web 服务器，防止 PHP 错误信息泄露绝对路径；由于 Cobub Razor 0.8.0 已停止维护且官方已转向 C4J 产品，建议迁移至 C4J（https://c4j.cn）或通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Nginx 的 location /tests/ 块返回 403）手动阻断对 tests/ 目录的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44495","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8770.yaml","https://github.com/Kyhvedn/CVE_Description/blob/master/Cobub_Razor_0.8.0_more_physical_path_leakage.md","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44495/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-8770.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8770.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-8770.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-8770-3647.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-8770-3650.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-8770-3649.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/razor-cve-2018-8770.yml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2018/CVE-2018-8770.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Western Bridge Cobub Razor/CVE-2018-8770.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/ARPSyndicate/nuclei/cvescan/medium/CVE-2018-8770.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0216.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0216.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0213","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0213.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8715","title":"Embedthis Appweb 认证绕过漏洞","description":"Embedthis AppWeb 及其 HTTP 库在 7.0.3 版本前存在认证绕过漏洞，根因是 http/httpLib.c 中 authCondition 函数的逻辑缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造特制 HTTP 请求，绕过表单认证和摘要认证机制，直接访问受保护资源。该漏洞影响所有使用 Embedthis HTTP 库且版本低于 7.0.3 的 AppWeb 服务器，CVSS 评分 8.1（高危），攻击复杂度高但无需权限和用户交互。攻击者仅需发送伪造的 HTTP 请求即可利用，成功利用可导致敏感信息泄露、权限提升及后续攻击。官方已在 7.0.3 版本修复该缺陷，建议受影响用户立即升级。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8715"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-15T01:29:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:05:16Z","remediation":"升级 Embedthis Appweb 至 7.0.3 或更高版本。如使用 Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS，请升级至 PAN-OS 6.1.21+、7.1.17+、8.0.10+ 或 8.1.1+。临时缓解措施：限制管理接口仅允许可信 IP 访问，并在网络层面过滤对管理接口的 HTTP POST 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blogs.securiteam.com/index.php/archives/3676","https://github.com/embedthis/appweb/issues/610","https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2018-8715","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8715.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-8715.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/appweb/CVE-2018-8715/README.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/appweb/CVE-2018-8715/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/be4eb5d180ce03ee7726c0a777ec4071d20eced1/2018/CVE-2018-8715.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8715.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-8715.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/中间件漏洞/AppWeb认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2018-8715.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-8715-3637.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-8715-3639.yaml","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/appweb/CVE-2018-8715.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0213.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0213.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0213.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0020","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-1000130","title":"Jolokia agent JNDI 注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Jolokia agent 1.3.7 版本在代理模式下存在 JNDI 注入漏洞。由于该版本未对用户输入的 JNDI 资源名称进行严格校验，远程未经身份验证的攻击者可通过发送特制的 HTTP 请求，诱导服务器连接到攻击者控制的恶意 RMI/LDAP 服务器，从而加载并执行任意 Java 代码，导致服务器被完全接管。此漏洞影响运行在代理模式下的 Jolokia agent 1.3.7 及其以下版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1000130"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-14T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:32:29Z","remediation":"建议将 Jolokia Agent 升级到 1.3.8 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，应在配置中关闭代理模式（proxy mode），或通过网络防火墙限制对 Jolokia 接口的外部访问，以防止远程攻击者利用 JNDI 注入执行代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:2669","https://jolokia.org/#Security_fixes_with_1.5.0","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000130.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-1000130.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/ab255c7216ed287f101e0ef82a9ced7168026cd9/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000130.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-1000130.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-1000130-3137.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-1000130-3134.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-1000130-3136.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Jolokia/CVE-2018-1000130.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-1000130/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2018-1000130.py","https://github.com/amcai/myscan/blob/c0ed549669ec76cc9fea660554943244cbdd703b/myscan/pocs/perfolder/jolokia/poc_jolokia_CVE-2018-1000130_2018.py","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-1000130.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0020.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0020.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0018","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-1000129","title":"红帽 Jolokia Agent 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Jolokia Agent 1.3.7 的 HTTP Servlet 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞（CWE-79），攻击者可通过精心构造的恶意请求将 JavaScript 代码注入到受害者的浏览器中。该漏洞允许未经身份认证的攻击者在目标用户浏览 Jolokia 管理控制台时执行任意脚本，窃取会话凭证或执行钓鱼攻击。攻击条件为攻击者需诱导受害者访问包含恶意载荷的特制 URL 或页面，受害者的浏览器在渲染页面时执行注入的 JavaScript 代码。该漏洞影响运行 Jolokia Agent 1.3.7 的 Java Management Extensions（JMX）管理接口，攻击者无需认证即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1000129"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-14T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:32:29Z","remediation":"立即将 Jolokia 升级至 1.5.0 或更高版本，该版本已在 AgentServlet.java 中添加回调参数（callback）与 MIME 类型参数的合法性校验，拒绝包含 HTML 标签或 JavaScript 代码片段的恶意回调名称。如暂时无法升级，可在 Jolokia 配置文件中禁用 callback 参数的 JSONP 输出功能或将 mimeType 严格限制为 text/plain 或 application/json，以阻断 XSS 攻击向量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:2669","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:3817","https://github.com/rhuss/jolokia/commit/5895d5c137c335e6b473e9dcb9baf748851bbc5f#diff-f19898247eddb55de6400489bff748ad","https://jolokia.org/#Security_fixes_with_1.5.0","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000129.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-1000129.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ae7cbf60471587bdea4445c1578df6c016019acf/2018/CVE-2018-1000129.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/de1ab28cf2828e2eb7b34b2d37efd0248f1a4d3a/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000129.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-1000129.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-1000129-3132.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-1000129-3129.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-1000129-3133.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-1000129-3130.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-1000129.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/high/CVE-2018-1000129.yaml","https://github.com/shoucheng3/rhuss__jolokia_CVE-2018-1000129_1-4-0"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0018.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0018.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0002","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0147","title":"Cisco Secure Access Control System Java反序列化漏洞","description":"Cisco Secure Access Control System（ACS）5.8 patch 9之前版本中存在Java反序列化安全漏洞。该漏洞源于受影响软件对用户提交的内容进行了不安全的反序列化处理，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的序列化Java对象触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标设备上以root权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响范围广泛，CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重，无需用户交互即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0147"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-08T07:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:56Z","remediation":"立即将 Cisco Secure ACS 升级至 5.8.0.32.9 Cumulative Patch 版本，可从 Cisco.com Software Center（产品路径：Security > Network Visibility and Enforcement > Secure Access Control System > Secure Access Control System 5.8）下载安装。该漏洞已在野被积极利用（CISA KEV 收录），无临时缓解措施，必须通过版本升级彻底修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103328","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040463","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180307-acs2","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0147","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0147.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0147.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0147.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-0147.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-0147.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-0147.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0147.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0147","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0147.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-0147.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0888","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0888.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-6530","title":"D-Link 多款路由器操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"D-Link 多款路由器（DIR-880L、DIR-868L、DIR-865L、DIR-860L）的 soap.cgi 接口存在操作系统命令注入漏洞，该漏洞位于 cgibin 二进制文件的 soapcgi_main 函数中。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过网络向目标设备的 service 参数注入恶意操作系统命令，成功利用后可完全控制受影响设备，实现信息窃取、恶意软件植入或发起后续攻击。攻击者只需向目标路由器的 Web 管理接口发送特制 HTTP 请求即可触发该漏洞，攻击复杂度低。受影响的固件版本包括 DIR-880L REVA FIRMWARE PATCH 1.08B04 及之前版本、DIR-868L FW112b04 及之前版本、DIR-865L REVA FIRMWARE PATCH 1.08.B01 及之前版本、DIR-860L FW110b04 及之前版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-6530"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-06T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:01:58Z","remediation":"立即将 DIR-880L 升级至 1.08B04 之后版本，DIR-868L 升级至 FW112b04 之后版本，DIR-865L 升级至 1.08.B01 之后版本，DIR-860L 升级至 FW110b04 之后版本。如无法升级，在路由器管理界面禁用远程管理功能，并在防火墙上限制对 TCP 端口 80/443 的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/TheBeeMan/Pwning-multiple-dlink-router-via-SOAP-proto","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-6530","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6530.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-6530.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6530.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-6530.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2018/6xxx/CVE-2018-6530.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b8f3faf694c27edd208769ff59c4ed562dd91eaa/2018/6xxx/CVE-2018-6530.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-20114.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/dlink/dir-860l_firmware/CVE-2018-6530.yaml","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2018-6530.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-6530.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-6530.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0888.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0202","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0202.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7662","title":"Webzyme CouchCMS 路径泄露漏洞","description":"CouchCMS 2.0 及之前版本存在路径泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，直接向目标系统发送请求访问 includes/mysql2i/mysql2i.func.php 或 addons/phpmailer/phpmailer.php 文件即可触发该漏洞，导致服务器返回完整物理路径信息。该漏洞可被攻击者用于收集目标环境信息，为后续深入攻击提供线索，影响所有使用 CouchCMS 2.0 及更早版本的网站。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7662"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-04T23:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:29Z","remediation":"升级 CouchCMS 到 v2.1 或更高版本以修复此路径泄露漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）配置中禁止直接访问 includes/ 和 addons/ 目录下的 PHP 文件，或在 php.ini 中设置 display_errors = Off 以禁止 PHP 错误信息输出，防止物理路径泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CouchCMS/CouchCMS/issues/46","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7662.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7662.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7662.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-7662.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-7662-3617.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-7662-3616.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/couchcms-cve-2018-7662.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/CouchCMS/CVE-2018-7662.yaml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2018/CVE-2018-7662.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2018/7xxx/CVE-2018-7662.json","https://github.com/amcai/myscan/blob/c0ed549669ec76cc9fea660554943244cbdd703b/myscan/pocs/perfolder/couchcms/poc_couchcms-cve-2018-7662_2018.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0202.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0202.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0201","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0201.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7653","title":"YzmCMS 3.6 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"YzmCMS 3.6 版本中的 index.php 页面存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞（XSS），由于对 a、c、m 等参数缺乏有效的过滤与转义处理，攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL 并诱导已登录用户点击，在用户浏览器中执行恶意 JavaScript 脚本，导致敏感信息泄露或页面内容篡改。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互，影响 YzmCMS 3.6 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7653"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-04T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:29Z","remediation":"升级 YzmCMS 至 3.7 及以上版本，该版本已修复 index.php 中 a、c、m 参数未过滤导致的 XSS 漏洞。如无法立即升级，在应用入口处对 `$_GET['a']`、`$_GET['c']`、`$_GET['m']` 三个参数做 HTML 实体编码过滤，禁止直接输出用户输入内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ponyma233/YzmCMS/blob/master/YzmCMS_3.6_bug.md","https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/147065/YzmCMS-3.6-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44405/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44405","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7653.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7653.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7653.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-7653.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2018/7xxx/CVE-2018-7653.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/yzmcms/yzmcms/CVE-2018-7653.yaml","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/YzmCMS/（CVE-2018-7653）YzmCMS v3.6 xss漏洞.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-7653.md","https://github.com/Mr-xn/Penetration_Testing_POC/blob/8dd4bd11727f92bfc44a4f742b79d2d09c1f5387/web/YzmCMS 3.6存在XSS漏洞.md","https://github.com/nosafer/nosafer.github.io/blob/1b07659147a7781a61e0b950684ad8d7739fadbd/docs/Web安全/YzmCMS/（CVE-2018-7653）YzmCMS v3.6 xss漏洞.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-7653.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0201.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0201.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0700","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0700.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-2380","title":"SAP CRM 路径遍历漏洞","description":"SAP CRM多个版本（7.01、7.02、7.30、7.31、7.33、7.54）存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22），由于系统对用户提供的路径信息缺乏充分验证，导致攻击者可利用\"..\"等父目录遍历字符绕过限制，访问受限文件API。攻击者需具备SAP CRM管理员凭据，通过向日志记录功能注入恶意路径，将JSP木马写入服务器文件系统，进而实现远程命令执行。该漏洞影响SAP NetWeaver AS Java CRM组件，CVSS评分6.6（中等），危害等级中等。SAP在2018年2月安全补丁日发布了修复程序，建议用户升级至已修补版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.6,"aliases":["CVE-2018-2380"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-03-01T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:55:36Z","remediation":"根据 SAP 安全公告 2018 年 2 月补丁日（SAP Security Patch Day February 2018）信息，此路径遍历漏洞已在 SAP 安全说明 2547431 中给出修复方案。受影响版本为 SAP CRM 7.01、7.02、7.30、7.31、7.33 和 7.54。首要措施是立即应用 SAP 软件更新管理器（SUM）下载并安装对应的安全补丁，对照 SAP Security Note 2547431 中的修正版本号，将受影响组件升级至已修复版本。若基础设施 WAR/EAR 部署在其他应用服务器上，则需同步更新该组件版本。对于短期内无法完成升级的系统，应在 Web  dispatcher 或反向代理层面实施 IP 白名单访问控制，仅允许管理面来源 IP 访问 /b2b/admin/logging.jsp 及相邻管理员页面，同时关闭未授权用户对 CRM 管理界面的访问路径，以缩小攻击暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103001","https://blogs.sap.com/2018/02/13/sap-security-patch-day-february-2018/","https://github.com/erpscanteam/CVE-2018-2380","https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/2547431","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44292/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-2380","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44292","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-2380.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/e6e8b9ac06818dca482495dce43afc9e74dfd4e2/2018/CVE-2018-2380.json","https://github.com/ym2011/POC-EXP/blob/206b22d3a6b2a172359678df33bbc5b2ad04b6c3/SAP CRM/CVE-2018-2380/README.md","https://github.com/ym2011/POC-EXP/blob/206b22d3a6b2a172359678df33bbc5b2ad04b6c3/SAP CRM/CVE-2018-2380/crm_rce-CVE-2018-2380.py","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-2380.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-2380.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-2380.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-2380","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-2380.rules","https://github.com/coreruleset/coreruleset/blob/76204946a679c0d5c634bd65e1d606f191ad756e/regex-assembly/942432.ra"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0700.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0700.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0700.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0197","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0197.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7467","title":"AxxonSoft Axxon Next 路径遍历漏洞","description":"AxxonSoft Axxon Next 视频监控管理系统存在路径遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在 URI 中使用 `/css/..%2f` 子串绕过路径限制，实现目录遍历。攻击者可利用该漏洞读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、系统文件等），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 AxxonSoft Axxon Next 全版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前官方尚未发布修复补丁，建议通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截包含 `..%2f` 的恶意请求进行缓解。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7467"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-27T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:10Z","remediation":"升级 Axxon Next 至厂商发布的最新版本。如无法升级，在反向代理或 WAF 层面拦截包含 `/css/..%2f` 的 URI 请求，并限制对 Axxon Next 服务的网络访问范围，仅允许受信任 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.projectxit.com.au/blog/2018/2/27/axxonsoft-client-directory-traversal-cve-2018-7467-axxonsoft-axxon-next-axxonsoft-client-directory-traversal-via-an-initial-css2f-substring-in-a-uri-cve-2018-7467","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7467.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7467.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7467.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-7467.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7467-3600.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7467-3598.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7467-3599.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2018-7467.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-7467/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2018-7467.py","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2018/7xxx/CVE-2018-7467.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/AxxonSoft Axxon Next/CVE-2018-7467.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0197.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0199","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0199.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7490","title":"uWSGI PHP 目录遍历漏洞","description":"uWSGI 在 2.0.17 之前版本中，当使用 --php-docroot 选项时未正确校验 DOCUMENT_ROOT 路径，导致存在目录遍历漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用路径穿越符（如 ../）绕过文档根目录限制，读取服务器上任意文件（如配置文件、源代码等），造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞无需任何权限即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响广泛部署的 uWSGI 应用服务器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7490"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-26T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:13Z","remediation":"升级 uWSGI 至 2.0.17 或更高版本，该版本已修复 --php-docroot 选项下 DOCUMENT_ROOT 路径校验不严导致的目录遍历漏洞。Debian 用户可参考 DSA-4142 通过 apt update && apt upgrade 获取安全更新。如无法立即升级，应避免使用 --php-docroot 参数，或通过 Web 服务器访问控制规则限制对敏感路径的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://uwsgi-docs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/Changelog-2.0.17.html","https://www.debian.org/security/2018/dsa-4142","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44223/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44223","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7490.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7490.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/uwsgi/CVE-2018-7490/README.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/uwsgi/CVE-2018-7490/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ab6f9d01ebd789d88d6c9c80d2c4801a89e1f38f/2018/CVE-2018-7490.json","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/中间件漏洞/uWSGI PHP目录穿越漏洞 CVE-2018-7490.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7490.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-7490.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7490-3602.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7490-3606.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-7490-3601.yaml","https://github.com/qinzhu111/uWSGI-CVE-2018-7490-POC"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0199.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0195","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0195.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7314","title":"Joomla PrayerCenter 3.0.2 SQL注入漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 PrayerCenter 3.0.2 组件存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者无需认证即可通过向 sessionid 参数传入特制的恶意 SQL 语句触发该漏洞，可导致数据库中的敏感信息泄露、数据篡改甚至完全控制服务器。该漏洞影响 Joomla! PrayerCenter 3.0.2 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。目前已公开 Exploit-DB 编号 44160 的利用代码，攻击者可通过发送构造的 HTTP 请求直接利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7314"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-22T19:29:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:00Z","remediation":"升级 PrayerCenter 组件至 3.0.6 或更高版本（Joomla 扩展目录最新版），该版本修复了 sessionid 参数未正确过滤导致的 SQL 注入问题。如无法升级，在 Joomla 全局配置中启用系统自带的输入过滤功能，或部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 SQL 关键字的 sessionid 请求参数。同时建议在 Web 服务器层面添加针对 `index.php?option=com_prayercenter` 路径的输入校验规则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exploit-db.com/exploits/44160","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44160","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7314.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7314.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7314.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/joomla-cve-2018-7314-sql.yml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2018/CVE-2018-7314.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2018/7xxx/CVE-2018-7314.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/xrayFiles/joomla-cve-2018-7314-sql.yml","https://github.com/awake1t/linglong/blob/bedbe49597412abab1c1635e133957d782e65325/pkg/pocs/joomla-cve-2018-7314-sql.yml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-7314/poc/xray/CVE-2018-7314.yml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/mlwebtechnologies/prayercenter/CVE-2018-7314.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-7314.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0195.toml"}]